    hint_tr: "Self-join: FROM orders o1 JOIN orders o2 ON o1.customer_id = o2.customer_id AND CAST(julianday(o2.order_date) - julianday(o1.order_date) AS INT) BETWEEN 1 AND 7. BETWEEN her iki uçtan dahildir; 1 aynı-gün çiftleri hariç tutar.",
